    },
    {
      "finding": "B1 counts grids in the reduced orbit and ranks by count descending, reduced-orbit mean Q descending, then deterministic grid key ascending.",
      "source": "src/orbit_consensus/baselines.py:17-34,44-48 (rank_candidates/majority_vote)"
    },
    {
      "finding": "M1 preparation and B1/M1/M2/M3 evaluation all consume the same reduced orbit; no full-orbit prepared workspace is passed in compute-matched evaluation.",
      "source": "src/orbit_consensus/arc1_analysis.py:168-205 (evaluate_orbits)"
    },
    {
      "finding": "emission keys, distinct modes, counts, pairwise similarity, centrality, weights, and mean-Q tie-breaks are all built from the reduced orbit only.",
